            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntihaze hagire ūryamana n’igitungano ic’ ari co cose, ngw aciyandurishe; kandi ntihaze hagire umugore cank’ umukobga ahagarara imbere y’igitungano ngw aryamane na co: ivyo vyoba ar’ukuvanga ibidahwanye.",
          "type": "text",
